{
	"name": "AI image carousel from a form to sprkly, held for approval",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "2ef09b65-35d7-4f09-954c-304ece264b1a",
			"name": "Overview",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-1000,
				-80
			],
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Turn a topic into an image carousel, checked by you\n\n### How it works\n- Fill in the form: a topic and the accounts to post to.\n- OpenAI plans the slides and the caption. fal.ai makes one image per slide with Imagen 4.\n- sprkly keeps each image, then makes ONE carousel post with the slides in order. Each slide gets its text as alt text.\n- The post has **Requires Approval** on. sprkly emails you an Approve link. Nothing goes out before you click it.\n- The AI lives in OpenAI and fal.ai. sprkly has no AI. It only publishes.\n- The form shows the result when it is done. It takes about a minute.\n\n### Setup\n- Needs the n8n-nodes-sprkly community node (Settings, Community Nodes).\n- Logins: a sprkly API key, an OpenAI key, a fal.ai key.\n- Make a Header Auth login: name `Authorization`, value: the word `Key`, a space, then your fal.ai key. Add it to **Make slide image**.\n- fal.ai bills you for every image.\n- Accounts look like `instagram:myhandle, tiktok:myhandle, threads:myhandle`.\n- sprkly API docs: https://sprkly.app/docs/api\n- Node: https://github.com/ahlanlhw/n8n-nodes-sprkly\n\n### Customize\n- In **Settings**: the number of slides (4), the image style, and how many hours from now it posts (3).",
				"height": 860,
				"width": 520,
				"color": 1
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "a9ea0b94-2800-4bfe-be21-e1977b168732",
			"name": "Note: plan slides",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-440,
				80
			],
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Plan the slides\nOpenAI returns the caption, a title for TikTok and one item per slide. The number of slides comes from Settings.",
				"height": 600,
				"width": 760,
				"color": 7
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "ad1f8c24-34af-4613-b01b-a35913b14015",
			"name": "Note: images and post",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				340,
				80
			],
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## One image per slide, one post\nEach slide image goes into sprkly and gives back a media ID. The IDs are collected in slide order and sent as one carousel, held for approval.",
				"height": 600,
				"width": 1320,
				"color": 7
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "0a672983-a51b-47a7-8be6-67eeaa0d30f3",
			"name": "Carousel form",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
			"typeVersion": 2.3,
			"position": [
				-400,
				320
			],
			"parameters": {
				"formTitle": "Make a carousel",
				"formDescription": "The post waits for your approval in sprkly before it goes out.",
				"formFields": {
					"values": [
						{
							"fieldLabel": "Topic",
							"fieldType": "textarea",
							"placeholder": "What should the carousel teach?",
							"requiredField": true
						},
						{
							"fieldLabel": "Accounts",
							"placeholder": "instagram:myhandle, tiktok:myhandle",
							"requiredField": true
						}
					]
				},
				"options": {}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "77ed03d9-5b72-41be-8a9c-f426574ebd8a",
			"name": "Settings",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
			"typeVersion": 3.4,
			"position": [
				-180,
				320
			],
			"parameters": {
				"assignments": {
					"assignments": [
						{
							"id": "3c793ca6-a2fc-4576-959a-6668fd13b24c",
							"name": "slides",
							"value": 4,
							"type": "number"
						},
						{
							"id": "8b8cc353-f0ea-49ce-aa47-1b19e8d8534d",
							"name": "imageStyle",
							"value": "clean flat illustration, bright colours, lots of empty space, one short headline in large bold letters",
							"type": "string"
						},
						{
							"id": "70d34347-28d0-4d18-90d6-a187284f2277",
							"name": "hoursFromNow",
							"value": 3,
							"type": "number"
						}
					]
				},
				"options": {}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "01b11215-77b7-48a2-9a6b-80d7e0350693",
			"name": "Plan the slides",
			"type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
			"typeVersion": 1.9,
			"position": [
				40,
				320
			],
			"parameters": {
				"promptType": "define",
				"text": "=Topic: {{ $('Carousel form').first().json.Topic }}\nNumber of slides: {{ $json.slides }}",
				"hasOutputParser": true,
				"messages": {
					"messageValues": [
						{
							"message": "You plan an image carousel for social media. Return exactly the number of slides asked for. Slide 1 is a hook, the last slide is a call to action. For each slide give \"text\": the headline shown on the slide, under 8 words, and \"image_prompt\": a picture that shows that headline in large letters. Also return \"caption\": under 1500 characters, plain words, and \"title\": under 80 characters. Do not make up facts, prices or numbers."
						}
					]
				},
				"batching": {}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "c10ac88e-08fc-4ca2-b7a9-c38e4603b066",
			"name": "OpenAI model",
			"type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
			"typeVersion": 1.3,
			"position": [
				20,
				520
			],
			"parameters": {
				"model": {
					"__rl": true,
					"mode": "list",
					"value": "gpt-4.1-mini",
					"cachedResultName": "gpt-4.1-mini"
				},
				"options": {},
				"builtInTools": {}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "9e0e8bc6-7bbf-44c9-9377-1f8da10a545f",
			"name": "Slide plan format",
			"type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
			"typeVersion": 1.3,
			"position": [
				200,
				520
			],
			"parameters": {
				"jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"title\": \"A short title\",\n  \"caption\": \"The post caption\",\n  \"slides\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Slide headline\",\n      \"image_prompt\": \"What the image shows\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "41e8daae-df33-49e2-9f85-7d7cfc480f34",
			"name": "One item per slide",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				380,
				320
			],
			"parameters": {
				"fieldToSplitOut": "output.slides",
				"options": {}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "ebfe529d-cc69-44a0-8a64-ef15aafa57fd",
			"name": "Make slide image",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
			"typeVersion": 4.2,
			"position": [
				600,
				320
			],
			"parameters": {
				"authentication": "genericCredentialType",
				"genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
				"options": {},
				"method": "POST",
				"url": "https://fal.run/fal-ai/imagen4/preview",
				"sendBody": true,
				"specifyBody": "json",
				"jsonBody": "={{ { prompt: $json.image_prompt + '. Style: ' + $('Settings').first().json.imageStyle, aspect_ratio: '1:1', num_images: 1 } }}"
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "75947db1-5c3b-4f5d-9bf3-e2cb49eb8caf",
			"name": "Add slide to sprkly",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-sprkly.sprkly",
			"typeVersion": 1.1,
			"position": [
				820,
				320
			],
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "media",
				"operation": "addFromUrl",
				"url": "={{ $json.images[0].url }}"
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "c317ced2-f909-4efa-b6cc-d4421d8c4127",
			"name": "Collect media IDs in order",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				1040,
				320
			],
			"parameters": {
				"fieldsToAggregate": {
					"fieldToAggregate": [
						{
							"fieldToAggregate": "mediaId"
						}
					]
				},
				"options": {}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "662a0a05-5b70-469b-bf83-d8b4d110714d",
			"name": "Post the carousel",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-sprkly.sprkly",
			"typeVersion": 1.1,
			"position": [
				1260,
				320
			],
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "post",
				"operation": "create",
				"accountMode": "name",
				"accountNames": "={{ $('Carousel form').first().json.Accounts }}",
				"caption": "={{ $('Plan the slides').first().json.output.caption }}",
				"scheduledTime": "={{ $now.plus({ hours: $('Settings').first().json.hoursFromNow || 3 }).toISO() }}",
				"mediaIds": "={{ $json.mediaId.join(',') }}",
				"output": "resultRow",
				"additionalFields": {
					"externalId": "={{ 'aicarousel-' + $execution.id }}",
					"requireExternalId": true,
					"requiresApproval": true,
					"approvalNote": "Slides made by OpenAI and fal.ai. Check every slide before you approve.",
					"title": "={{ $('Plan the slides').first().json.output.title }}",
					"altText": "={{ $('One item per slide').all().map(slide => slide.json.text).join('\\n') }}",
					"tiktokPrivacyLevel": "PUBLIC_TO_EVERYONE"
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "9b84b238-6ee2-4734-913b-2c31008e0c69",
			"name": "Show the result",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.form",
			"typeVersion": 2.3,
			"position": [
				1480,
				320
			],
			"parameters": {
				"operation": "completion",
				"respondWith": "text",
				"completionTitle": "={{ $json.ok ? 'Waiting for your approval' : 'Not scheduled' }}",
				"completionMessage": "={{ $json.ok ? 'Your carousel is in sprkly. Approve it from the email sprkly sent you. Post ID: ' + $json.postId : 'sprkly did not take it: ' + $json.error }}",
				"options": {}
			}
		}
	],
